33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Does anyone have any information or suspicions already?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, listen! I know who the werewolf is! It's Shion!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
