44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,See! He's just trying to act cool!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,Being logical isn't a crime. Kenji is just desperate for attention.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should trust the Seer's lead for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
